# The breakdown loses a reason: its rows no longer account for every non-compliant value.
MODULE: ReasonsSumToNonCompliantReasonDropped
TARGET: ReasonsSumToNonCompliant
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a non-compliant value under one reason is counted without its breakdown row
PERTURBS: Step

--- FIND
                          /\ reasonCount' = [reasonCount EXCEPT ![d] = @ + 1]
--- REPLACE
                          /\ reasonCount' = IF d = "RA" THEN reasonCount ELSE [reasonCount EXCEPT ![d] = @ + 1]
--- END
